Jude Shin (jshin53@calpoly.edu)

All parts of this program were completed.

The base code for lab_06 was used. Basic Blinn-Phong lighting was implemented
in for all meshes in my scene. I also added a color vec3 for the lights. This
uniform variable is passed into the shaders. These values are normalized rgb 
values from 0.0 to 1.0. For the static light, I keep it as a "white" color 
(1.0, 1.0, 1.0), but the light that moves has a more yellow tint (0.9, 0.8, 
0.05).

Keyboard controls implemented:
"q" -> a light to the left
"e" -> a light to the right
"a" -> rotates the view of the camera to look more left
"d" -> rotates the view of the camera to look more right 
"w" -> translate the camera up
"s" -> translate the camera down 

